+# Autopilot Cost Controls & Safe Scaling Policy
+
+Policy
+------
+- When quota_enforcer indicates cost > threshold, autopilot_gatekeeper flips autopilot-config.enabled=false.
+- Non-critical training/compile jobs should be labeled with aegis:priority=low and have lower autoscaler limits.
+- Critical inference and safety verification jobs should be protected by budget allowances.
+
+Operational steps
+1. Ensure quota_enforcer runs periodically and writes /tmp/quota_report.json.
+2. The autopilot_gatekeeper reads the report and toggles autopilot configmap to disable autopilot.
+3. Operators review billing issue and re-enable autopilot via configmap after remediation.
+
